# Loaded only for `vite dev` / dev-mode builds, never for a production build.
# Production leaves this unset and falls back to window.location.origin —
# the SPA and API are genuinely same-origin there (ADR-0005). In dev, the SPA
# and API run as separate processes on separate ports, so this points
# directly at the real API port; the backend's dev-only CORS policy
# (Program.cs) allows this SPA origin to reach it.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5299
